          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "parent_column": "left",
            "enlarge_text": true,
            "text": "<h3>WIRING KIT INCLUDED</h3><ul><li>(1) 6.5mm to RAW Cooper</li><li>(1) 6.5mm to 3.5mm input cable</li><li>(1) 6.5mm to RCA</li><li>(1) 3.5mm to 3.5mm</li></ul><p>* Plus additional cables and connectors for additional configurations.</p>"
